      "originalText": "fuzzy, edit distance 1 (>= 4 chars, words only):\n\"setings\" -> hash of itself + its 7 one-char deletes\n= 8 lookups in FUZZY KEYS (sorted u32 hash, rank)\n\"settings\" stored its own deletes, one is \"setings\"\n-> shared key -> verify restricted damerau <= 1\n-> settings, weight 0.6",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
