      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "aT",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "ONE FORWARD PASS over entries (parents always before children, BFS order from the snapshot):\nown = scores[name[i]]      ancestors = carried[parent[i]]      carried[i] = bytewise max(own, ancestors)   (one pmaxub)\nper term: best = max(own x lengthNorm, ancestors x 0.5)      lengthNorm = 1 / (1 + 0.08 x (words in name - 1))\nscore = sum(idf share x best) x (terms matched / terms matchable)^2  -  0.01 x depth\nentries where own | ancestors == 0 cost a load, a max and a compare; matches go to a top-100 heap\n\n.../Microsoft.WindowsTerminal_8wekyb3d8bbwe/LocalState/settings.json: windows+terminal from an ancestor (x0.5), setings~settings in the name -> all 3 terms",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 938757389,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "text": "ONE FORWARD PASS over entries (parents always before children, BFS order from the snapshot):\nown = scores[name[i]]      ancestors = carried[parent[i]]      carried[i] = bytewise max(own, ancestors)   (one pmaxub)\nper term: best = max(own x lengthNorm, ancestors x 0.5)      lengthNorm = 1 / (1 + 0.08 x (words in name - 1))\nscore = sum(idf share x best) x (terms matched / terms matchable)^2  -  0.01 x depth\nentries where own | ancestors == 0 cost a load, a max and a compare; matches go to a top-100 heap\n\n.../Microsoft.WindowsTerminal_8wekyb3d8bbwe/LocalState/settings.json: windows+terminal from an ancestor (x0.5), setings~settings in the name -> all 3 terms",
      "textAlign": "center",
